      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I as a deaf gamer do have really difficult times communicating with people when it’s not in an asl world. I find people talk to me in worlds like Murder 4 where there’s no pens and makes it difficult to communicate. I have it standing in my bio that I’m deaf but I find many people getting annoyed by me as they think I’m ignoring them so they begin punching and just shooting me whenever. It makes it difficult just having fun playing the game when people just go to kill me cause they think I’m just rude. At this point being able to chat would really be a big help.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
